WEBVTT

00:07:28.244 --> 00:07:31.681
And if I were to drop too low,

00:07:31.681 --> 00:07:33.850
I’d seize,

00:07:33.883 --> 00:07:35.085
and I'd die.

00:07:35.452 --> 00:07:39.556
Now there's a more subtle notification

00:07:39.589 --> 00:07:41.591
for when my blood sugar is high.

00:07:42.392 --> 00:07:44.394
An obnoxious vibrating.

00:07:45.762 --> 00:07:49.666
But if I were to spike too high,

00:07:49.699 --> 00:07:51.234
it's DKA.

00:07:52.669 --> 00:07:57.874
And this device on my arm
that's saving my life,

00:07:57.907 --> 00:07:59.776
it's considered a luxury.